{"thread":{"threadID":4384,"boardID":121,"topic":"Admin skin","time":1490884143,"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","lastPostTime":1495643904,"lastPoster":"Nachtfrische","replies":8,"views":116,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":1,"cumulativeLikes":4},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":64186,"threadID":4384,"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","subject":"Admin skin","time":1490884143,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":4,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1490885905,"value":1},{"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","time":1490886120,"value":1},{"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","time":1490889563,"value":1},{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1490903804,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hello Dream Admin team.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>I have bought a admin skin ( <strong>Crysis Nanosuit</strong> ) and the hands are bugged ( I&#x27;m not sure if you guys can fix that )</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span><br><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ps. Thanks <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2043-apudox/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@ApudoX</a> for a small loan of 15k <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😏</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Kind Regards</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Michal &quot;OxygeN&quot; J.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":64190,"threadID":4384,"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","subject":"","time":1490889603,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1490903736,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Well it is not necessarily a bug. It looks like a terminators hand.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":64191,"threadID":4384,"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","subject":"","time":1490889717,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1490903800,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Well it can be classified as a bug as both skins overlap but the default shows more making it look weird from admin/player p.o.v</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":64192,"threadID":4384,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1490890097,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","time":1490890375,"value":1},{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1490891288,"value":1},{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1490903733,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Sorry, not fixable.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>When the glove update hit CS:GO, they broke the &quot;arms&quot; of every custom player model.<br>Some models include extra arms which you can only see in first person (e.g. your second screenshot shows that pretty well), however, because you can also equip custom gloves, they overlap with the player model.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>The solution is either to remove custom arms or to leave it the way it is now.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":64193,"threadID":4384,"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","subject":"","time":1490890413,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Well I guess we can remove it from the p.o.v but keep them in actual skin.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Thanks for the information <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1825-nachtfrische/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Nachtfrische</a></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":64206,"threadID":4384,"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","subject":"","time":1490901805,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1490903793,"value":1},{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1490904131,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>In my opinion we should keep it in. I don&#x27;t mind that bug and if somebody does I guess he/she can stop using it and everybody will be happy. <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span> have a nice evening <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":64220,"threadID":4384,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1490955336,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","time":1490956255,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>have same problem <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙁</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":64222,"threadID":4384,"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","subject":"","time":1490957422,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","time":1490958968,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Not sure if this is ClientSide</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>Mike</strong></cite><p>have same problem<br></p></blockquote><blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>Nachtfrische</strong></cite><p>Sorry, not fixable.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>When the glove update hit CS:GO, they broke the &quot;arms&quot; of every custom player model.<br>Some models include extra arms which you can only see in first person (e.g. your second screenshot shows that pretty well), however, because you can also equip custom gloves, they overlap with the player model.<br></p></blockquote><p>//closed</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":66518,"threadID":4384,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1495643904,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2229,"username":"WHAT","time":1495644274,"value":1